    failing-checks section, which is left out when nothing fails. [38;5;153mtest/status.test.js[39m gets updated, with new tests
    written first. [38;5;153mREADME.md[39m gets a line about the new output.
  - [1mSnapshot order:[0m unchanged. Failing services aren't moved to the top unless you want that.
